== bold: the favour the new representative asks / R
base: refuse flat, and walk out of the office
likelier_if: has [public speaking] +10; mark 'defied an authority' +5
- R | stand up at the street meeting and tell everyone what the office asked of you | v: self-direction, benevolence | act: stand up at the street meeting and tell everyone what the office asked of them | chance: 35 | grants: good name in town | takes_if_fails: friend in power
works: The hall goes quiet, then the street applauds, and from then on {Ns} name counts for something in town.
works: The road plan is dropped, and people all over town say {N} is someone who tells the truth.
fails: The meeting turns on {N} for having worked for the office at all, and the representative never calls again.
fails: Nobody believes {N} at the meeting, and the representative, told about it by morning, drops {N} for good.

